<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 72-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 72-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, 89 runs ahead of South Africa on first innings, were 72 without loss in their second innings at lunch on the fourth day of the third and final test at the Wanderers on Sunday</p>
<p>Scores: India 410 and 72-0, South Africa 321.</p>
</text>
